gates/realize_graph_census-gate.py	py-main	USAGE	PASS/PASS	PASS	0	WITHIN-LIMITS	880.0	27.46	realize_graph_census-gate: 1004 rows (15 drivers x 65 nodes + 15 bottom + 12 arm-coverage + 2 header), 3 lanes, 941 answers match CPython byte-for-byte and 63 are DECLARED divergences over NINE classes -- OF THOSE 1004 ROWS ONLY 611 CARRY A COMPARISON: 378 are the CALL-only drivers refusing a non-CALL (both lanes answer `notacall`, so they count as matches) and 15 are `Arena.bottom()`, where CPython has no node. 15 divergences are that bottom, 13 are `get_call_name`'s STORE arm and its fallthrough, 12 are `prg.arg.vars` over a non-`ProgramInfo` body, 10 are `pm_validate`'s UNPORTED BODY (claim against cone), 8 are a CALL whose `src[1]` is not a PARAM or a BUFFER, 2 are `inputs[slot]` where CPython has no default, 1 is the MSELECT `storage_base` wall, 1 the MSTACK walk. THE `SRC_BODY` CLASS IS GONE: 52 rows that used to be realize.py:15's UNCONDITIONAL `src[1:]` against the port's op-CONDITIONAL `Arena.src_without_body` now AGREE, and `classes_hold` asserts every one of them still does -- **AND `rz_bound_map`, the SECOND of its two fix sites, IS NOT COVERED BY ANY OF THEM: MEASURED, reverting it moves ZERO rows, because no driver reaches `get_call_var_uops` on a non-CALL (`var` is refused there by `u.body`) and for a CALL the two spellings ARE the same slice. The port's own comment says so; this header did not.** ONE FINDING STANDS: `res_63` -- HEAD's `_resolve` has an `Ops.GETADDR` arm and `rz_arm` does NOT, so a GETADDR argument is left un-resolved; IT VANISHES UNDER THE PIN `ad117c928^`, whose line 129 has no GETADDR, so the port is correct against the pin and incomplete against HEAD, and `pin_drift_holds` runs the pin's code on every run to keep saying so. `ret is not uop` IS FIXED: the 8 `bea0_*` rows agree on `10` -- CLAIMED and the rewrite was the identity -- and the ctx-7 rows still begin `11` and carry `b=7`. **THE TWO BITS ARE WHY `rz_kernel_beam`'s NO-`KernelInfo` DEFAULT IS A ROW AT ALL: with the old single bit, mutating that default `0` -> `1` moved ZERO of the rows (`V2`, reported as vacuous), because the claim was folded away.** THE `kern` DRIVER COMPARES A COUNT WHERE THE THINGS ARE NAMES, and `kern_blind_holds` measures why that is the CEILING -- `device_vocab_holds` MEASURES THE PREMISE EVERY RUN (CPython has no `str -> int` device index: `hasattr(Device,'tag')` is False, `ParamArg.device` is a `str`, `Device.__getitem__` is string-keyed) and the port's own `tag_of` is a three-valued sentinel -- while a TWO-DEVICE node makes the count 2 on both lanes. The gate no longer justifies that wall by naming a symbol in `uop/spec.bend`'s comment; it measures the wall, and `uop/spec.bend`'s three `Device.tag` citations were rewritten to the mechanism those measurements describe. THE `arg` PAYLOAD IS IN EVERY TOKEN NOW: TWO FIXTURE NODES THAT PRINT ALIKE ARE TWO NODES A READER CAN CONFUSE, AND MEASURED OVER THE 65 NODES THIS CENSUS SPELLED 32 DISTINCT TOKENS FOR 65 NODES -- 147 of the 2080 pairs indistinguishable -- against 60 and 8 after, every one of the eight a pair whose TWO ARGS ARE EQUAL. `argkinds_hold` REQUIRES THAT NO LANE PRINTED THE `[?]` AN UNSPELLED `Arg` KIND WOULD PRINT. THE DRIVER AXIS IS READ BACK FROM FOUR PLACES BY `axis_hold`: the oracle's `DRIVERS` BY PATH, the oracle's `drive` ladder, and the bend lane's own `rs_drv_name` and `rs_d.go`.
